  "statuteText": "665:9-a Administrative Complaint Resolution. –\n\nThe ballot law commission shall hear and resolve complaints of federal voting law violations, pursuant to the Help America Vote Act of 2002, Public Law 107-252, as provided in RSA 666:14."
